{"4907380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TAKEDOWN 16", "steam_appid": 4907380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic action titles, TAKEDOWN 16 is a high-speed vehicular action-roguelite fueled by one solo dev's passion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE YEAR... 20XX</strong> — A corporate utopia masks a sinister reality controlled by an omnipotent AI. Run after run, you must break the system from the inside out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/999525544a63a8224c10135e32b6d86f.poster.avif?t=1786819454\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/999525544a63a8224c10135e32b6d86f.webm?t=1786819454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/999525544a63a8224c10135e32b6d86f.mp4?t=1786819454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focuses on fast vehicular combat and building synergies. Runs begin with a basic chassis and escalate as you gather items and artifacts to face limitlessly scaling defensive forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/41050cc4b49b23c6f5c24305723dd92c.poster.avif?t=1786819454\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/41050cc4b49b23c6f5c24305723dd92c.webm?t=1786819454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/41050cc4b49b23c6f5c24305723dd92c.mp4?t=1786819454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat Vehicles:</strong> Drive specialized combat machines, each featuring distinct handling profiles and primary armaments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Synergies:</strong> Collect items to scale your run's capabilities and generate powerful effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sinister Dystopia:</strong> Fight through a megocorporation's gleaming exterior across a variety of stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic Retro Aesthetic:</strong> Low-poly 3D models combine with crunchy pixel-art textures to evoke the golden era of classic PSX action titles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo-Developer Passion Project:</strong> Built independently by one developer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/514d5d2dcc89ac768703c14b18b7e5e8.poster.avif?t=1786819454\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/514d5d2dcc89ac768703c14b18b7e5e8.webm?t=1786819454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/514d5d2dcc89ac768703c14b18b7e5e8.mp4?t=1786819454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dobert_dev welcomes you... to the world of TAKEDOWN 16.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic action titles, TAKEDOWN 16 is a high-speed vehicular action-roguelite fueled by one solo dev's passion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE YEAR... 20XX</strong> — A corporate utopia masks a sinister reality controlled by an omnipotent AI. Run after run, you must break the system from the inside out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/999525544a63a8224c10135e32b6d86f.poster.avif?t=1786819454\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/999525544a63a8224c10135e32b6d86f.webm?t=1786819454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/999525544a63a8224c10135e32b6d86f.mp4?t=1786819454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focuses on fast vehicular combat and building synergies. Runs begin with a basic chassis and escalate as you gather items and artifacts to face limitlessly scaling defensive forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/41050cc4b49b23c6f5c24305723dd92c.poster.avif?t=1786819454\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/41050cc4b49b23c6f5c24305723dd92c.webm?t=1786819454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/41050cc4b49b23c6f5c24305723dd92c.mp4?t=1786819454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat Vehicles:</strong> Drive specialized combat machines, each featuring distinct handling profiles and primary armaments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Synergies:</strong> Collect items to scale your run's capabilities and generate powerful effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sinister Dystopia:</strong> Fight through a megocorporation's gleaming exterior across a variety of stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic Retro Aesthetic:</strong> Low-poly 3D models combine with crunchy pixel-art textures to evoke the golden era of classic PSX action titles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo-Developer Passion Project:</strong> Built independently by one developer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/514d5d2dcc89ac768703c14b18b7e5e8.poster.avif?t=1786819454\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/514d5d2dcc89ac768703c14b18b7e5e8.webm?t=1786819454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/extras/514d5d2dcc89ac768703c14b18b7e5e8.mp4?t=1786819454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dobert_dev welcomes you... to the world of TAKEDOWN 16.</p>", "short_description": "A high-speed vehicular action-roguelite. Master unique rides, stack exponential item synergies, and break an omnipotent corporate AI. Survival demands unrelenting aggression to shatter a polished utopia in this chaotic, adrenaline-fueled experience.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4907380/bdd404eb6fcf73cac658e4b72a80025e73c8dc97/header.jpg?t=1786819454", "capsule_image